{
  "id": "c1-e25-the-gig-economy",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "The gig economy",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good afternoon. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e25-the-gig-economy/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, would you prefer a permanent job or a variety of short projects?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e25-the-gig-economy/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5900
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how important is job security to you?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e25-the-gig-economy/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, do you know anyone who works for themselves?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e25-the-gig-economy/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4100
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, what do you think are the main advantages of freelance work?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e25-the-gig-economy/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e25-the-gig-economy/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e25-a1",
            "c1-e25-a2",
            "c1-e25-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show people who work independently. Choose two of the pictures and say what the people might like about this kind of work, and what insecurities they could have.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e25-the-gig-economy/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12400
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these jobs would you consider doing?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e25-the-gig-economy/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e25-b1",
            "c1-e25-b2",
            "c1-e25-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show people dealing with work. Choose two of the pictures and say what pressures the people might feel, and how they might cope.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e25-the-gig-economy/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10100
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think self-employed people have more freedom than employees?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e25-the-gig-economy/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some things that could improve life for people who work on short contracts, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e25-the-gig-economy/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12200
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e25-the-gig-economy",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these measures improve life for freelance and short-contract workers?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e25-the-gig-economy/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 8100
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e25-the-gig-economy",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which would make the greatest difference?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e25-the-gig-economy/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about freelancing and the gig economy.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e25-the-gig-economy/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Does the gig economy give people more freedom, or does it simply make work less secure?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e25-the-gig-economy/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6200
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, to what extent should online platforms be responsible for the people who work through them?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e25-the-gig-economy/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7000
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think permanent jobs will become rare in the future?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e25-the-gig-economy/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "How might the gig economy change the way young people plan their lives?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e25-the-gig-economy/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, should freelancers have the same rights as employees?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e25-the-gig-economy/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, is it possible to feel loyalty to a company if you only work for it for a short time?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e25-the-gig-economy/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7200
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
